WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:03.520
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.520 --> 00:06.110
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.780 --> 00:10.180
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.880 --> 00:14.890
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.260 --> 00:17.790
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.130 --> 00:21.570
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.320 --> 00:28.540
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.220 --> 00:34.300
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.100 --> 00:37.590
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.590 --> 00:40.200
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.720 --> 00:47.980
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.950 --> 00:51.710
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.770 --> 00:54.610
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.900 --> 00:55.930
♪Let me♪

00:56.120 --> 01:00.200
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.650 --> 01:03.330
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.620 --> 01:06.320
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.490 --> 01:07.960
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.960 --> 01:12.130
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.490 --> 01:22.740
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.170 --> 01:29.720
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.920 --> 01:32.800
=Episode 20=

01:45.200 --> 01:46.160
Storm the city!

01:55.840 --> 01:57.440
Attack!

02:49.520 --> 02:50.360
Sweetie.

02:50.480 --> 02:51.720
This pot looks pretty heavy.

02:52.280 --> 02:54.280
If the Wutuo forces really break in,

02:54.530 --> 02:55.440
can you even swing it?

02:56.760 --> 02:57.600
No, I can't.

02:57.600 --> 02:58.440
But I'll throw it

02:58.480 --> 02:59.440
at them.

03:00.000 --> 03:01.680
Killing one enemy is good.

03:01.880 --> 03:02.720
Killing two

03:03.160 --> 03:04.000
is better.

03:08.520 --> 03:09.360
With enemies coming,

03:09.720 --> 03:10.840
we must stand united.

03:11.160 --> 03:12.080
Jiyang is my home.

03:12.800 --> 03:13.680
If home is gone,

03:14.520 --> 03:15.840
what's the point of living?

03:16.320 --> 03:17.160
Exactly.

03:17.160 --> 03:19.010
My brother and father are
on the battlefield.

03:19.120 --> 03:21.000
I want to cheer them in victory.

03:21.440 --> 03:22.440
You're right.

03:22.880 --> 03:23.720
Women

03:24.040 --> 03:25.280
should also be tough.

03:25.680 --> 03:27.360
If officials' families only

03:27.440 --> 03:28.440
want self-preservation,

03:29.079 --> 03:30.360
how can we expect soldiers

03:30.480 --> 03:31.600
to fight on the front lines?

03:32.800 --> 03:34.000
Let's fight enemies!

03:34.000 --> 03:36.480
- Sure!
- Let's fight them!

04:38.710 --> 04:41.020
(Compassionate Salvation)

04:41.060 --> 04:43.220
(Radiant Illumination)

05:01.000 --> 05:01.840
Who are you?

05:06.960 --> 05:08.360
That's not important. Attack!

05:44.320 --> 05:45.400
Charge!

05:46.480 --> 05:47.320
(Three Passes)
Fire arrows!

05:50.680 --> 05:51.520
Feinu.

05:52.040 --> 05:53.570
You lead the vanguard out of the city.

05:53.840 --> 05:55.040
Muyi will lead Jiyang troops

05:55.120 --> 05:55.960
to guard the gate.

05:56.360 --> 05:57.840
Not a single Wutuo man

05:58.640 --> 06:00.000
shall enter Jiyang!

06:00.440 --> 06:01.560
- Understood!
- Understood!

06:08.720 --> 06:09.560
Once the gate opens,

06:10.040 --> 06:12.040
lead the main force
against the Wutuo army first.

06:13.120 --> 06:14.360
Then I'll take an elite squad

06:15.440 --> 06:17.280
to divert Huyate
and his heavy armor troops,

06:18.240 --> 06:19.970
luring them away
from the main battlefield.

06:20.360 --> 06:21.560
The remaining Wutuo forces

06:22.320 --> 06:23.400
will be leaderless.

06:26.280 --> 06:27.120
Commander.

06:27.600 --> 06:28.720
Let me lead the elite squad

06:29.120 --> 06:31.000
to lure away Huyate and his heavy armor.

06:32.040 --> 06:32.880
No.

06:33.159 --> 06:34.200
To divert Huyate,

06:34.200 --> 06:35.840
we need someone of high standing.

06:36.200 --> 06:37.600
The Wutuo loathe me.

06:38.600 --> 06:39.440
Therefore,

06:40.320 --> 06:41.520
I'm the right one.

06:42.680 --> 06:44.159
Actually, in Jiyang, there is someone

06:45.440 --> 06:46.280
of higher standing

06:46.680 --> 06:47.680
than you.

06:53.200 --> 06:54.040
Quick!

07:13.880 --> 07:15.520
You want to impersonate Princess Mengji?

07:16.160 --> 07:17.000
Yes.

07:28.800 --> 07:30.280
Do you understand the risks?

07:32.200 --> 07:33.159
I do,

07:34.080 --> 07:35.440
so I can't let you go.

07:37.320 --> 07:38.720
As our commander-in-chief,

07:39.640 --> 07:41.120
the entire army's fate relies on you.

07:42.600 --> 07:44.200
You can't take unnecessary risks.

07:48.920 --> 07:49.760
I know you are

07:50.560 --> 07:51.760
worried about my safety.

07:52.760 --> 07:54.120
But you must realize

07:54.960 --> 07:56.320
that once I wear this armor,

07:57.159 --> 07:58.360
I become a soldier,

07:59.280 --> 08:00.320
fearless of death.

08:06.080 --> 08:06.920
Medic!

08:07.840 --> 08:08.680
Come quickly!

08:08.680 --> 08:09.520
There's another one!

08:09.520 --> 08:10.360
Hurry!

08:11.760 --> 08:12.600
Move faster!

08:12.840 --> 08:13.800
He Yan, receive orders!

08:17.240 --> 08:18.120
Come back alive.

08:20.040 --> 08:20.920
Yes!

08:35.679 --> 08:36.520
Quickly!

08:37.000 --> 08:37.840
Medic!

08:39.000 --> 08:39.840
Medic!

08:40.520 --> 08:41.360
Hurry!

08:42.080 --> 08:42.919
He's dying!

08:42.919 --> 08:43.760
Let me check.

08:53.120 --> 08:53.960
Faster!

08:56.240 --> 08:57.080
This will hurt.

09:01.200 --> 09:02.040
Bear with it.

09:08.760 --> 09:09.600
Alright.

09:53.840 --> 09:54.680
Prepare the horses!

09:54.680 --> 09:55.520
Yes!

10:01.640 --> 10:02.520
Charge!

10:03.320 --> 10:06.240
- Attack!
- Attack!

10:36.740 --> 10:38.000
Whoever captures Xiao Jue alive

10:38.000 --> 10:40.840
will be handsomely rewarded.

10:41.400 --> 10:42.280
- Attack!
- Attack!

10:49.160 --> 10:51.320
Attack!

11:32.480 --> 11:34.040
Mu Hongjin is trying to escape.

11:34.200 --> 11:36.200
Heavy infantry! Capture her alive!

11:57.160 --> 11:58.000
(He Yan.)

11:58.560 --> 11:59.920
(You must return safely.)

12:17.200 --> 12:18.280
Seize Mu Hongjin!

12:18.480 --> 12:19.400
Don't let her escape!

12:35.240 --> 12:36.080
(Wutuo forces)

12:36.080 --> 12:37.440
(are accustomed to land battles.)

12:37.680 --> 12:39.280
(Horses aren't water-adept.)

12:39.280 --> 12:40.800
There's a riverbank east of the city.

12:41.320 --> 12:42.280
It's a risky move.

12:42.560 --> 12:43.560
Destroy the leader first.

12:44.120 --> 12:45.040
Capture Huyate,

12:45.280 --> 12:46.920
and the battle can turn around.

13:13.920 --> 13:15.240
You're not Mu Hongjin.

13:15.640 --> 13:17.000
Trash like you

13:17.200 --> 13:18.760
isn't worth Her Highness' effort.

13:19.560 --> 13:21.080
You're courting death.

13:56.080 --> 13:57.600
You're seeking death!

13:57.840 --> 14:00.360
I'm killing you at any cost.

14:15.760 --> 14:16.680
(Chai Anxi?)

14:38.760 --> 14:39.760
I just spotted Chai Anxi.

14:39.880 --> 14:40.720
But he vanished.

14:41.240 --> 14:42.300
You must find him.

14:42.760 --> 14:43.600
Yes.

15:34.120 --> 15:35.040
(Dear sister,)

15:36.080 --> 15:38.480
(I gave you mercy.)

15:39.280 --> 15:40.720
(Yet you rejected it.)

15:40.800 --> 15:42.640
(You let me down.)

15:42.720 --> 15:43.870
(Bring honor to our family?)

15:44.000 --> 15:45.240
(You don't deserve to do that.)

15:45.240 --> 15:47.200
(My family needs only one heir.)

15:47.280 --> 15:48.360
(Prepare to die!)

15:48.880 --> 15:50.080
(Prepare to die!)

15:51.080 --> 15:53.080
(Our family doesn't need you.)

15:53.160 --> 15:54.200
(Your death)

15:54.720 --> 15:56.680
(will ensure our family's peace.)

16:59.680 --> 17:00.520
Commander.

17:01.200 --> 17:03.240
Commander, have we won?

17:06.440 --> 17:07.280
Listen.

17:08.000 --> 17:09.000
We've won.

17:09.000 --> 17:12.640
- We've won!
- We've won!

17:18.760 --> 17:19.599
Great!

17:20.280 --> 17:21.160
We've won.

17:25.560 --> 17:26.400
Indeed.

17:28.119 --> 17:28.960
We've won.

17:30.600 --> 17:31.440
- We won!
- We won!

17:31.520 --> 17:32.680
- We won!
- We won!

17:32.680 --> 17:33.720
- We won!
- We won!

17:34.840 --> 17:35.680
- We won!
- We won!

17:41.920 --> 17:42.760
- We won!
- We won!

17:43.400 --> 17:44.440
We won!

17:49.880 --> 17:50.800
Splendid!

17:52.040 --> 17:52.880
- We won!
- We won!

17:55.800 --> 17:56.640
- We won!
- We won!

17:58.160 --> 17:59.000
We won!

17:59.000 --> 17:59.840
We won!

17:59.920 --> 18:01.760
- We won!
- We won!

18:03.000 --> 18:03.840
We won!

18:05.160 --> 18:06.000
We won!

18:06.400 --> 18:07.240
Brilliant!

18:07.560 --> 18:08.440
- We won!
- We won!

18:11.200 --> 18:12.040
We've won!

18:13.720 --> 18:14.560
We've won!

18:15.440 --> 18:16.280
Your Highness.

18:16.960 --> 18:17.800
We've won.

18:58.260 --> 18:59.780
♪I've seen the mountains♪

18:59.780 --> 19:01.330
♪And trodden through ice♪

19:01.330 --> 19:03.780
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

19:04.310 --> 19:05.890
♪Destiny is my creed♪

19:05.890 --> 19:07.450
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

19:07.450 --> 19:09.780
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

19:10.550 --> 19:12.010
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

19:12.010 --> 19:13.570
♪Gazing through the mire♪

19:14.920 --> 19:15.760
What's on your mind?

19:16.210 --> 19:18.060
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

19:19.720 --> 19:20.560
Nothing.

19:22.520 --> 19:24.720
Let's report to Her Highness.

19:26.290 --> 19:28.800
♪There must always be a longing♪

19:29.360 --> 19:33.880
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

19:33.880 --> 19:34.720
Hold my hand.

19:34.720 --> 19:36.880
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

19:36.980 --> 19:40.900
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

19:40.900 --> 19:43.020
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

19:43.020 --> 19:47.040
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

19:47.040 --> 19:48.980
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

19:49.160 --> 19:52.990
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

19:53.240 --> 19:59.000
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

19:59.880 --> 20:03.960
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

20:03.960 --> 20:04.920
You've all worked hard.

20:05.280 --> 20:06.880
On behalf of Jiyang's people,

20:07.640 --> 20:08.520
I thank you all.

20:09.480 --> 20:10.320
My pleasure.

20:10.680 --> 20:11.520
Protecting the nation

20:11.840 --> 20:12.680
and people

20:13.160 --> 20:14.480
is our duty.

20:15.000 --> 20:15.840
That's an honor.

20:16.520 --> 20:17.920
Congratulations, General Fengyun.

20:19.600 --> 20:20.640
I'm glad you're safe.

20:21.520 --> 20:22.600
I appreciate your concern.

20:25.120 --> 20:25.960
Your Highness.

20:26.520 --> 20:29.040
I found Mr. Liu's body near the mansion.

20:29.600 --> 20:32.080
There were many Wutuo men's bodies
surrounding him.

20:32.920 --> 20:34.360
Their weapons were poisonous.

20:35.120 --> 20:36.280
Mr. Liu was fatally poisoned.

20:36.280 --> 20:37.310
Enemies outnumbered him.

20:37.880 --> 20:38.800
He died of exhaustion.

20:46.040 --> 20:47.080
My master?

20:48.920 --> 20:49.760
That's not true.

20:53.200 --> 20:54.280
My master couldn't have...

21:39.480 --> 21:41.440
(This pair of bracelets
is called Joyful Hearts.)

21:42.240 --> 21:44.670
Lovers wearing them

21:45.160 --> 21:46.440
will never be parted.

21:48.520 --> 21:50.040
Is this your beloved?

21:52.560 --> 21:54.000
(Buy a pair for the lady.)

21:54.440 --> 21:56.800
You two will be together forever.

21:57.680 --> 21:58.680
Did you hear that?

21:59.240 --> 22:00.350
Aren't you buying me this?

22:03.000 --> 22:04.120
She's not my beloved.

22:21.200 --> 22:22.280
Liar.

22:23.920 --> 22:24.840
You liar.

22:32.960 --> 22:33.800
What's wrong?

22:34.640 --> 22:35.480
Are you upset?

22:35.880 --> 22:36.770
None of your business.

22:38.080 --> 22:39.360
Did I upset you?

22:43.080 --> 22:43.920
Liu Buwang.

22:43.920 --> 22:45.380
Why didn't you buy me the bracelets?

22:46.200 --> 22:47.320
If it were anything else,

22:47.520 --> 22:48.640
I'd promise you.

22:49.040 --> 22:49.880
Really?

22:50.280 --> 22:51.440
Don't trick me again.

22:52.600 --> 22:53.440
I mean it.

22:56.160 --> 22:57.000
Well,

22:57.520 --> 22:58.920
go outside the city with me?

23:00.760 --> 23:01.920
I'll share a secret.

23:02.360 --> 23:03.200
In a temple

23:03.400 --> 23:05.090
lies a passage leading out of the city.

23:06.400 --> 23:07.240
A passage?

23:07.640 --> 23:08.800
You already promised me.

23:08.800 --> 23:09.640
Keep your word.

23:09.720 --> 23:10.560
Let's go.

23:13.950 --> 23:14.920
(Radiant Illumination)
Here we are.

23:15.240 --> 23:16.900
Alright.

23:22.430 --> 23:25.440
♪Through endless nights, I walk alone♪

23:25.440 --> 23:28.740
♪Heartache swirls like ceaseless winds♪

23:33.220 --> 23:36.350
♪Yet I yearn to stand opposed to you♪

23:36.350 --> 23:39.950
♪Seeking fleeting clarity♪

23:40.420 --> 23:44.210
♪Imprisoned within memories♪

23:44.640 --> 23:47.270
♪Upon towering fortress walls♪

23:47.270 --> 23:50.050
♪Brooding over lamented pasts♪

23:50.050 --> 23:52.910
♪Where shall light be found♪

23:53.200 --> 23:55.170
♪Once♪

23:55.600 --> 23:57.970
♪I had an unbreakable faith♪

23:59.080 --> 24:00.040
Jiyang

24:01.240 --> 24:02.080
is safe now.

24:02.600 --> 24:03.680
That's good.

24:03.680 --> 24:06.320
♪I'm shrouded in darkness♪

24:06.590 --> 24:09.720
♪Resent old dreams like drifting clouds♪

24:10.210 --> 24:11.680
♪Heartache♪

24:11.890 --> 24:15.170
♪Resenting the lonely years♪

24:15.600 --> 24:17.340
♪Why♪

24:17.340 --> 24:19.070
♪Not let it go♪

24:20.080 --> 24:24.490
♪Tears crystallize to frost♪

24:25.560 --> 24:28.190
♪Clutching stubborn obsessions♪

24:28.460 --> 24:31.590
♪Yet falling into folly♪

24:31.870 --> 24:33.700
♪Fading into oblivion♪

24:33.700 --> 24:36.830
♪Yet memories surge everywhere♪

24:37.810 --> 24:40.540
♪After the separation♪

24:40.540 --> 24:46.290
♪Who will be with you♪

24:53.600 --> 24:54.640
Hongjin.

25:09.170 --> 25:11.620
♪You are my light♪

25:11.760 --> 25:12.720
Hongjin.

25:13.800 --> 25:15.480
I wish you peace.

25:15.570 --> 25:17.210
♪Get lost♪

25:19.000 --> 25:19.960
Live

25:22.000 --> 25:24.640
well.

25:25.330 --> 25:29.640
♪Mournful through night skies♪

25:30.900 --> 25:33.670
♪How dare I hope♪

25:33.670 --> 25:37.380
♪That twilight outshines vastness♪

25:37.380 --> 25:39.070
♪Ultimately♪

25:39.070 --> 25:42.850
♪Await ancients
to bid farewell to the past♪

25:43.250 --> 25:46.020
♪After parting♪

25:46.020 --> 25:52.490
♪My heart feels adrift♪

27:02.480 --> 27:03.960
Maybe I should go check on them.

27:04.440 --> 27:05.280
No.

27:05.360 --> 27:06.480
This is not something

27:06.840 --> 27:08.280
you and I can fix.

27:09.840 --> 27:11.560
Leave them alone for a moment.

27:33.800 --> 27:34.640
Commander.

27:34.760 --> 27:36.000
Thanks for guarding the door.

27:39.400 --> 27:40.480
Why are you staring at me?

27:41.320 --> 27:42.800
Is there something on my face?

27:48.880 --> 27:49.720
Ugly.

27:51.440 --> 27:52.280
What?

27:52.840 --> 27:53.960
It makes you ugly

27:55.080 --> 27:55.920
when you lie.

28:02.800 --> 28:03.640
I've told you.

28:04.960 --> 28:05.920
Just cry or laugh

28:06.760 --> 28:07.600
if you want to.

28:08.480 --> 28:09.520
Just be yourself.

28:10.960 --> 28:12.200
You don't have to act.

28:15.080 --> 28:15.920
It looks unnatural.

28:17.760 --> 28:18.720
I'm not acting.

28:20.240 --> 28:21.080
It's just

28:22.560 --> 28:23.600
that I can't help.

28:26.280 --> 28:27.200
What do you mean?

28:29.720 --> 28:30.560
Commander.

28:31.480 --> 28:33.000
In this world, only a few people

28:34.000 --> 28:34.920
who treated me well.

28:36.800 --> 28:38.240
Less than five people.

28:48.600 --> 28:49.880
Now, one of them is gone.

29:13.560 --> 29:19.710
(Tomb of Hermit Yunlin Liu Buwang)

29:35.280 --> 29:36.120
Yan.

29:36.880 --> 29:38.360
I'm sorry for your loss.

29:39.440 --> 29:40.280
Miss He.

29:40.720 --> 29:41.560
I'm so sorry.

29:42.600 --> 29:43.440
Miss He.

29:44.320 --> 29:45.440
We're all mere mortals.

29:46.600 --> 29:48.120
Who can truly remain detached?

29:49.280 --> 29:51.000
If we don't force ourselves
to let it go,

29:51.600 --> 29:52.520
what else can we do?

29:56.720 --> 29:57.680
Mr. Liu was

29:58.520 --> 29:59.440
free and unrestrained.

30:01.040 --> 30:02.360
If he saw you grieving like this,

30:03.040 --> 30:04.200
he would worry about you.

30:05.480 --> 30:06.320
The living

30:07.080 --> 30:08.280
must move on.

30:10.240 --> 30:11.120
They say

30:12.400 --> 30:13.320
that the deceased

30:14.320 --> 30:15.840
would cross the River of Forgetfulness

30:16.680 --> 30:17.790
to reach the other shore.

30:20.480 --> 30:21.400
But what's it like

30:24.000 --> 30:25.120
across the river?

30:52.600 --> 30:53.440
Master.

30:54.880 --> 30:56.320
According to Jiyang's customs,

30:57.040 --> 30:57.880
tonight,

30:58.360 --> 30:59.680
the family should prepare food

31:00.520 --> 31:01.560
to send off the departed.

31:03.360 --> 31:04.200
I have

31:04.520 --> 31:06.680
prepared your favorite dishes.

31:07.440 --> 31:08.280
Jiyang

31:08.560 --> 31:10.120
is now recovering steadily.

31:10.880 --> 31:11.720
All is well.

31:12.480 --> 31:13.320
And everyone is safe.

31:15.360 --> 31:16.280
Master.

31:17.760 --> 31:19.000
May you rest in peace.

31:22.160 --> 31:23.000
Let me

31:23.760 --> 31:24.600
toast you.

31:47.360 --> 31:48.200
Your Highness.

31:49.000 --> 31:51.200
I brought some dishes for your master.

32:04.000 --> 32:05.320
After all these years,

32:06.440 --> 32:08.600
your master's taste in food
remains unchanged.

32:13.520 --> 32:14.480
Sweet and sour fish.

32:15.000 --> 32:16.080
You didn't put any sugar

32:16.480 --> 32:17.920
in this dish?

32:18.640 --> 32:19.600
My master

32:20.200 --> 32:23.000
loved sugarless sweet and sour fish.

32:23.800 --> 32:26.040
He never put sugar in it.

32:26.520 --> 32:27.760
I used to tease him

32:28.440 --> 32:30.680
that it was sweet and sour fish
without sugar,

32:31.040 --> 32:33.160
and he could eat sour fish.

32:34.280 --> 32:35.200
Only later did I know

32:36.040 --> 32:37.200
it was because the one

32:37.800 --> 32:39.480
my master had been missing

32:40.720 --> 32:41.760
liked

32:42.280 --> 32:43.800
to eat sugarless sweet and sour fish.

32:47.480 --> 32:48.320
I always knew

32:49.240 --> 32:50.360
he liked me.

32:52.720 --> 32:53.800
I refused to meet him

32:54.640 --> 32:55.880
because he broke his promise.

33:01.480 --> 33:02.400
But the bracelet

33:02.400 --> 33:03.240
made me realize

33:03.520 --> 33:04.920
he must have had his reasons.

33:05.520 --> 33:06.560
Thinking about it now,

33:07.040 --> 33:08.520
what difference would it make?

33:09.160 --> 33:12.120
I'm Mu Hongjin of the Mengji Mansion.

33:12.640 --> 33:14.160
I'm Mu Hongjin of Jiyang.

33:14.800 --> 33:15.640
I could never

33:16.600 --> 33:18.120
be his Mu Hongjin.

33:22.080 --> 33:22.920
He Yan.

33:23.400 --> 33:25.080
Fate didn't bind me to your master,

33:25.640 --> 33:26.560
but I've genuinely

33:26.800 --> 33:28.320
come to regard you as family.

33:29.160 --> 33:30.640
My greatest regret

33:30.960 --> 33:32.080
is that I didn't go out

33:33.240 --> 33:34.720
to meet him that night.

33:36.360 --> 33:38.240
Even just a glimpse from afar

33:39.120 --> 33:39.960
would be better.

33:46.880 --> 33:48.640
Cherish the one you like.

33:49.720 --> 33:50.720
Don't repeat the mistake

33:51.360 --> 33:52.880
your master and I made.

33:54.720 --> 33:55.640
It's lucky

33:56.240 --> 33:57.720
to meet the one you love

33:57.800 --> 33:59.400
in your life.

34:00.360 --> 34:01.520
Once you find the right one,

34:02.000 --> 34:03.640
don't let him go.

34:04.480 --> 34:05.600
Give him a chance

34:06.080 --> 34:06.920
and trust him.

34:07.680 --> 34:09.040
It also means a chance for you.

34:14.840 --> 34:15.840
I see, Your Highness.

34:37.960 --> 34:38.800
Commander.

34:39.000 --> 34:39.840
Why are you here?

34:40.520 --> 34:41.360
Once you returned,

34:41.560 --> 34:42.760
you went to restaurants,

34:43.239 --> 34:44.480
preparing food for Mr. Liu.

34:45.440 --> 34:46.440
But you eat nothing.

35:03.160 --> 35:04.000
Let's eat together.

35:34.720 --> 35:35.560
Sir.

35:35.560 --> 35:37.160
Xiao Jue has taken Chai Anxi back.

35:37.160 --> 35:38.480
Chai Anxi is now unconscious.

35:38.800 --> 35:40.120
He's now at the Cui Mansion.

35:40.400 --> 35:41.520
Cheng Lisu and Song Taotao

35:41.520 --> 35:42.360
are treating him.

35:42.480 --> 35:43.680
Chancellor Xu sent a letter,

35:43.680 --> 35:45.060
urging you to act quickly.

35:45.060 --> 35:46.840
Should I go kill Chai Anxi now?

35:46.960 --> 35:47.800
I suspect

35:48.160 --> 35:49.720
Chai Anxi holds crucial information.

35:50.240 --> 35:51.920
So, I need to verify details with him.

35:52.920 --> 35:54.320
Have you noticed something?

35:54.360 --> 35:55.200
Chai Anxi

35:55.200 --> 35:56.640
was Xiao Zhongwu's deputy general.

35:56.960 --> 35:58.760
He faked his death
after the Mingshui Battle.

35:58.760 --> 36:01.080
Xiao Jue's search for him
is understandable.

36:02.080 --> 36:03.320
But to kill him,

36:03.720 --> 36:04.680
Chancellor Xu sent me

36:05.440 --> 36:06.520
and even contacted Wutuo.

36:07.400 --> 36:08.440
It makes me realize

36:08.760 --> 36:09.960
that he and Chai Anxi must

36:10.200 --> 36:11.040
share a dark history.

36:11.520 --> 36:12.440
Are you suspecting

36:12.700 --> 36:15.000
Chancellor Xu is related
to the Mingshui Battle's defeat?

36:15.000 --> 36:16.520
We'll know the answer

36:17.080 --> 36:18.400
when Chai Anxi wakes.

36:19.400 --> 36:20.840
Chai Anxi knows you.

36:21.600 --> 36:22.440
If he wakes,

36:22.560 --> 36:24.040
will he implicate you?

36:24.240 --> 36:25.080
No.

36:25.600 --> 36:27.000
Chai Anxi values loyalty.

36:27.080 --> 36:27.920
He'd never

36:27.920 --> 36:29.800
betray his lifesaver.

36:30.320 --> 36:31.160
Moreover,

36:32.120 --> 36:33.200
even if he says something,

36:33.880 --> 36:35.320
I have contingency plans.

36:36.640 --> 36:38.400
Now that Chai Anxi's at the Cui Mansion,

36:38.920 --> 36:40.320
as an Inspector,

36:40.760 --> 36:41.680
I should pay a visit.

37:08.240 --> 37:09.800
Though Chai Anxi's life is stabilized,

37:09.960 --> 37:10.920
his injuries are severe.

37:11.520 --> 37:12.930
Song Taotao is preparing medicine.

37:13.200 --> 37:14.040
I'll leave it to you.

37:16.960 --> 37:17.800
Chu Zhao?

37:18.840 --> 37:19.680
What brings you here?

37:29.840 --> 37:30.680
Commander Xiao.

37:34.240 --> 37:35.520
I heard General Fengyun

37:35.760 --> 37:36.680
found a soldier

37:37.160 --> 37:38.120
who supposedly died

37:38.160 --> 37:39.120
at the Mingshui Battle.

37:39.640 --> 37:41.000
I wonder why a dead man

37:41.240 --> 37:42.320
came back to life.

37:42.800 --> 37:44.160
It's pretty strange.

37:44.520 --> 37:45.920
As an Inspector,

37:46.320 --> 37:47.320
I must figure this out.

37:48.040 --> 37:48.880
It made sense.

37:49.880 --> 37:50.960
I just found this man

37:51.440 --> 37:52.600
and wanted to inform you.

37:52.960 --> 37:53.800
But unexpectedly,

37:54.080 --> 37:54.920
you came.

37:56.160 --> 37:57.320
You are

37:57.840 --> 37:58.920
so well-informed.

38:01.080 --> 38:02.000
I have to be alert

38:02.320 --> 38:03.760
as His Majesty's courtier.

38:05.680 --> 38:06.760
He remains unconscious,

38:07.120 --> 38:08.160
so we can't question him.

38:08.160 --> 38:09.000
However,

38:09.000 --> 38:10.080
Cheng Lisu and Song Taotao

38:10.360 --> 38:11.640
are trying to treat him.

38:12.040 --> 38:12.880
When he wakes,

38:13.480 --> 38:14.680
you'll be informed.

38:15.200 --> 38:16.640
Thanks, Commander Xiao.

38:17.200 --> 38:18.520
I'll take my leave.

38:20.520 --> 38:21.360
See you.

38:22.520 --> 38:23.360
See you.

38:29.800 --> 38:30.640
Commander.

38:30.760 --> 38:32.160
Why share details with him?

38:32.840 --> 38:33.920
He's Xu Jingfu's disciple.

38:34.520 --> 38:35.640
He's up to no good.

38:36.800 --> 38:38.080
His official position

38:38.760 --> 38:39.680
grants him authority.

38:40.760 --> 38:42.440
Avoidance won't work.

38:44.720 --> 38:45.560
Post more guards

38:46.000 --> 38:46.840
around the courtyard.

38:47.600 --> 38:48.600
Prevent the opponents

38:49.200 --> 38:50.040
from breaking in.

38:50.920 --> 38:51.760
Yes.

38:56.070 --> 38:58.230
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

38:58.330 --> 39:02.250
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

39:02.430 --> 39:04.370
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

39:04.470 --> 39:09.400
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

39:21.490 --> 39:22.900
♪I've seen the mountains♪

39:23.100 --> 39:24.510
♪And trodden through ice♪

39:24.780 --> 39:27.600
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

39:27.900 --> 39:29.290
♪Destiny is my creed♪

39:29.350 --> 39:30.750
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

39:30.900 --> 39:32.700
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

39:33.900 --> 39:35.370
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

39:35.540 --> 39:36.820
♪Gazing through the mire♪

39:37.000 --> 39:39.390
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

39:39.590 --> 39:41.640
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

39:42.780 --> 39:44.610
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

39:46.570 --> 39:49.480
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

39:49.570 --> 39:52.240
♪There must always be a longing♪

39:52.690 --> 39:57.750
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

39:58.090 --> 40:00.090
